# Copy to provider-customization.properties (same directory) before using
# Claude subscription login. API keys do not need this value.
#
# OAuth requests must open their system prompt with the identifying line
# Claude Code itself sends, or the endpoint rejects them. OpenMinis ships
# this empty in its public mirror (see BUILDING.md) and points at other
# GPL/open clients that declare the same line. The one-line default below
# is that publicly documented identifier, not Anthropic's full system prompt.
# Replace it if the endpoint starts requiring a newer line.
ANTHROPIC_OAUTH_IDENTIFIER_PROMPT=You are Claude Code, Anthropic's official CLI for Claude.
